<Base title="Website Demo Privacy Notice" description="The Flock Built Performance GitHub Pages demo keeps sample quote details and photos inside your browser tab. No form data is sent or stored." path="/privacy/">
<section class="page-hero section"><div class="breadcrumbs"><a href={url("/")}>Home</a><span>/</span>Privacy</div><span class="eyebrow">WEBSITE DEMONSTRATION / CLIENT REVIEW</span><h1>Demo Privacy Notice</h1><p class="page-display">YOUR DETAILS.<br/><span>STAY WITH YOU.</span></p></section>
<article class="section prose"><h2>Sample requests stay in your tab.</h2><p>Use sample details. This static demonstration validates form input, processes optional photos and creates a sample receipt entirely in your browser. It sends no form text or photos to a server, email account, phone or lead database. It does not book appointments or take payments.</p><p>The page keeps your input while the tab is open so you can edit or retry. Reloading or closing the page clears the form state. A receipt you choose to download remains on your device.</p><p>Optional JPEG, PNG and WebP photos are resized and re-encoded in your browser. Original image metadata is not included in the processed copy. No photos are uploaded.</p><h2>Hosting and links.</h2><p>GitHub Pages serves the website files and may process ordinary hosting request information under GitHub's privacy policies. The demo includes no analytics, tracking pixels, embedded maps or embedded social feeds. A session-only flag remembers the decorative lights-on effect; it does not contain personal details.</p><p>Call and text links open your device's phone or messaging app using the supplied business number. Instagram and directions links open third-party services only if you choose them. Their own privacy policies apply.</p><h2>Before a final business website.</h2><p>The final live website needs client-approved content and a tested, approved quote delivery and privacy setup. No live delivery or retention policy is active in this demo.</p><p>For business enquiries, use the provided shop contact links. For this presentation, talk with Patrick.</p></article>
</Base>
